<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
    The launch screen: full-bleed gradient, nothing else.

    No mark, no wordmark, no spinner. This is the collapse's *first* frame,
    not its last — the OS paints this, our first view paints the same image,
    and the contraction begins with no visible handoff. Anything drawn here
    that the collapse does not also draw becomes a flash.

    Pinned to the superview rather than the safe area on purpose, so it runs
    under the status bar and past both insets.
-->
